[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今度こそ全員無事戻ったか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It looks like everyone has made it safely this time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000無事解決したはず……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! I think we've covered our bases..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫だよ、レスナちゃん。全員いる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry, Resna. Everyone's here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "解決しました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We did it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはよかった……姫、無事で何より",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's a relief... Princess, I'm glad you're safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、えっと、ご心配おかけしました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, um, sorry for worrying you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほらロロナさん。ぽやっとしてないで\nさっさと準備するわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, Rorona. Stop spacing out and hurry up with the preparations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ。はいっ、ミミちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Right, Mimi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ何か問題が残っているのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are there still loose ends to take care of?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ。そうじゃないんですけど、\n本の中でまだやることがあって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, not quite, but there's still something we want to do inside the book."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさか、またあの中へ行こうというのか。\n再び閉じ込められる危険は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Surely you don't mean to go back in there again. The danger of being trapped once more..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうか。君は成し遂げたい何かがあるのだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand. This is something you're determined to accomplish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ならば姫を護るのは騎士の務め。\n最後まで共に在ろうじゃないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then protecting the princess is a knight's duty. I shall remain with you until the end."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "騎士様……はいっ、よろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sir Knight... Yes, thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]